#: scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4774a9704f9af27151279310a36df4545f5d96a15f9793b06a2f07448f3c4581
#. default-sha256: a9912f4e40a1f8731b8ffa9853362a8be14beebf0189aed0d3b4867613fa056d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_2969C666_724A_4A50_88D6_FC4F569A6141"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫The mansion sat near "
"the ocean."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫A mansão ficava perto "
"do oceano."

#: scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80b98540ecf8d16acf7e7727c6b4b5db148ca1a5eb14817c31fc8a5598147124
#. default-sha256: 1ded739abb37486b1e1b5cb77fb0216ff22cbd3ae22c65ffecf5f2fa9f7a6554
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_25E93473_3C7F_47AF_B45C_9D323A6F3D5A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫To say it was perched upon a cliff might make it sound rather intimidating..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Dizer que estava empoleirada em um penhasco pode soar bastante intimidante..."

#: scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e80d1d66f0d05bc6a0455a439c26256bb8f92f8c2f96197632a34804eaeac8c2
#. default-sha256: de247ce6d53a8e7b36d9ad7e6bd2036cc4d89299580774e699cc3023e20946aa
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_685FCB43_1481_45D7_BBBE_8FB9C1AC2175"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫but you could see the beautifully clear sea through the windows—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫a glittering "
"expanse of emerald and turquoise."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫mas você podia ver o claro e belo mar através das janelas—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫uma extensão brilhante "
"de esmeralda e turquesa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 67ace5119be26536c9fe551469003ec9bcb0470943ac0c8c8c29f6a65cca0c3a
#. default-sha256: b7d7b33aea3b2726afbc85ef615e99cb03ca30c98703711951fe7d52a5d46b88
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A319AAD1_7EC5_4829_AA77_42149F2755E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If the mansion had been in proper condition, it would have been breathtaking against "
"that backdrop."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Se a mansão estivesse em condições adequadas, seria de tirar o fôlego contra aquele "
"pano de fundo."

#: scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bdb87096e0ec4aa1987b2584d5ab1d0581ba57fd2acea690ce2aa7b11ef83e56
#. default-sha256: ff4390fb3af18d28ce7031a03995c35f8785ad9963e442a8c692c1d09a909c37
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_0159B64C_5EDC_4035_9E3A_A504D7D567BF"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I even wanted to plant orange trees in the garden."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu até queria plantar laranjeiras no jardim."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0ae49cda2ee8756f62bd539d3051a573c305fdd13198b5cab561f1de348ba3ce
#. default-sha256: 3c05387319c5a92a4c3c72282bd95521fb0bbb6286bd9c76d1708fe6a8771d16
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C0EFF7A2_48B2_4EB6_AF03_BD062798B84A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Though it was a tumultuous era, the sun still shone bright upon the land, which only served "
"to emphasize the house’s unsightliness."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora fosse uma época tumultuada, o sol ainda brilhava sobre a terra, o que só serviu para "
"enfatizar a falta de beleza da casa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2243bd25dbbaf5b1d0f9e108e2dfa4c32af608416311350591507ac2fc04650b
#. default-sha256: d914271ba3d732628a017e5a9884a2f718b42c7f48cee4f8e634e6887128d4d8
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_F40581AD_5819_4290_BCF0_FDEF7F40476F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oh yes, perhaps I should give you some more background information. ⟪k:1⟫At that period in "
"time, a war had just drawn to a close."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ah, sim, talvez eu devesse lhe dar mais algumas informações contextuais. ⟪k:1⟫Naquele "
"período, uma guerra havia acabado de chegar ao fim."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2eca937fa815cb88b96b63f8dcd1c9cb7f54a85f3d82bf55a73c81226efd2d3d
#. default-sha256: 9386dce662b4f27c86be12c536bbe81645320195144b9fec2e94ae0e3bad465e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B6FE0EFE_F238_4376_A78D_6B7BADCD9866"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The once gorgeous wetlands were infested with crows picking at decaying "
"remains. Bodies of soldiers fallen in battle continually washed up on the shores of coastal "
"villages."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Os outrora lindos pântanos estavam infestados de corvos catando restos "
"em decomposição. Corpos de soldados caídos em batalha eram continuamente levados às margens das "
"aldeias costeiras."

#: scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a6a0b2ba4de4643d83c2b284617172fe5c07183343a0a14ec521092ebd7d4daa
#. default-sha256: ed18b946d817e38f21d9cba1214dce31fc698fd8516833efc331c46bfa0e48fd
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_7B0AC144_0BB9_4AFB_97DD_31740DBF1CB0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The people wanted nothing more than for the curtain to draw on that deeply political contest."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫O povo não queria nada mais do que a cortina se fechasse naquela profunda disputa política."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 349b5f66cf3ff9571c42db20acbd0f4ec627fa8d97af816cc41ec1ea570580b6
#. default-sha256: 14e67d9bb6923358c7b9033724f2aead36020ba9f4d0e59b1d05decf7f4a724a
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B8D6AF17_A0A1_476A_9A57_430A2AB83B0A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And when it finally did, the kingdom, with its richly fertile shores, was stripped of its "
"independence, beginning a new era under new rule."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫E quando finalmente o fez, o reino, com suas margens ricamente férteis, foi destituído de "
"sua independência, iniciando uma nova era sob novo domínio."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb9d32b51e425de7004dbf89fe2f6141f369f1a057945bb03461f594e3a5a64e
#. default-sha256: c4b7a9da127603bcb19d9538f58b0d75d2ba71a61e98ba96da3c4994d87df074
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A9FF47C2_8D32_4008_AB0B_61249DC285D0"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The people were exhausted, their spirits wasted away."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫As pessoas estavam exaustas, seus espíritos esgotados."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ecd32f502eb5d6a45688519dac9c949a3bf220f55a2e63b4ee8a98842b142101
#. default-sha256: 1be333c78aa935f942b3eee9724e36f0361c677af8e764043e53df333c3321d2
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7EED3DA_F03C_489C_9F20_EE195A4DDC86"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the splendor of the ocean and sky did nothing to help."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E o esplendor do oceano e do céu não ajudou em nada."

#: scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1168f25858136b9bdbb0b877ab432d761717a50d46de6ca803ee9bc7023f1ed1
#. default-sha256: 7a8e639e2a37daec2f94a7e10ceb56831dceeaf0c90abb972ad03775fbeaeeed
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_765E8C91_48F4_49B8_8547_EF0E80F51144"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In my mind, the beast was emblematic of the times—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emaciated and enveloped in the "
"scent of blood."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Em minha mente, a fera era uma representação dos tempos—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫emagrecida e envolta em "
"cheiro de sangue."

#: scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9975aff88ce423ad109289f91f438b7229983fdc5f0a1e7db6872da9c367b56b
#. default-sha256: 7d1b86806771afd73d435700955b221fe027eed3a0c86c05329070b22b1d6d5d
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B395005F_CE73_4906_BCB7_C1626238D28A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But the war came to an end. ⟪k:1⟫Thus the beast did not have to remain a beast, I thought."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mas a guerra chegou ao fim. ⟪k:1⟫Assim, a fera não precisava continuar sendo uma fera, "
"pensei."

#: scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 656b6fa5dd994eff82b26f08929b4b2cb73383d3bb8d3e87eff938c14a585d9b
#. default-sha256: 0a9b2fa15dcdf10f0491ede735e9398c6b7c70b0455ba4781444487d379af923
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_EF4D48BD_1DEF_4547_9C87_2A8273C54029"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Did he?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Precisava?"

#: scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cdc3600345307d55bc18dbbcf830eaf1dfa9fe9c0d674a6f2dcf75f95cf3db01
#. default-sha256: abadb6071129818ba954331581095d58e5ac09155069e863f18208ae04cde0e9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_B3B52B41_BC9E_441C_A36F_517C882497EB"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And so, I endeavored to make the beast more human-like."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫E assim, me esforcei para tornar a fera mais humana."

#: scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: df6bc80875b8df78f19fe8483fd45a0e088022817302d9227955c10cc78aca87
#. default-sha256: e62e44aab2a3b8fc166e8ed45a54dd5deabe88981a256121181244ad236c57af
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_36A1DD21_9EA4_4212_8CD9_A97D7F84D621"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫First, I needed to do something about his appearance."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Primeiro, eu precisava fazer algo sobre sua aparência."

#: scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4fc75f0875ef244605e49d6d75318eba83cf7302c19328ac6a728703e7bc177f
#. default-sha256: 22ce23ef259d82fb7e6fb4bff54cd5e281c526fc97c53944341562f72e9f7d8e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_FE16B9C9_16C1_4888_9F02_485BEF2C7FF1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I would draw a bath, scrub away all the filth, and dress him in clothing left in the mansion."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Eu prepararia um banho, esfregaria toda a sujeira e o vestiria com as roupas deixadas na "
"mansão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 754e11f0fda984fbfde96478b15297448a26d271dbd999ca7c12501cc8faf49d
#. default-sha256: 237313c6f62ac174cd7cf07a68d2d1449d8c21b0e3d1c32a1b431cbf39df4d98
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_48B55AE9_720E_4D2B_ACE8_AE4BB780A80C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫However, having sat unused for fifty years, the majority of garments had been devoured by "
"insects and were of little use."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No entanto, tendo ficado sem uso por cinquenta anos, a maioria das roupas havia sido "
"devorada por insetos e era de pouca ajuda."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eeed7654ccf8991205ac08e6d78ab875d2d32a022190054472ae07d35fede152
#. default-sha256: 6249120d85af4866e9827c8a709dca6f1c12dfa2e69f4954956d25f86b219465
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D98AAD6D_E96B_4693_A747_C4715DFAB52D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫So I searched the mansion top to bottom for anything the beast could wear, heated up some "
"coals, and set to work ironing what I found."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Então, procurei na mansão de cima a baixo qualquer coisa que a fera pudesse usar, aqueci "
"algumas brasas e comecei a trabalhar passando o que encontrei."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2b6e4e06ab29634158b157d2e55388f24e7536627962074e3562d2e562ddc387
#. default-sha256: ade6959b8170688d113d0afc5f80afd8cdba5af8e03ff7f7016f322be539d92e
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A38703AC_3901_46C2_8B90_D4A6D91C8C6F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At the time, steam irons had not yet been invented. We used plates of iron heated with coals."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Na época, os ferros a vapor ainda não haviam sido inventados. Usávamos chapas de ferro "
"aquecidas com carvão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd231c2043c0d210b3f43048751dbaf17557612b9cd5a54f0ed172e260a72f57
#. default-sha256: 3a5295bcfd4081b38c24d243d0d4f3a33ccd23a02682f82193b97b685f514cf9
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_D14A52B0_E3D7_45DA_AC8E_0606CC01932A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫They somewhat resembled kettles."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Elas se assemelhavam um pouco a chaleiras."

#: scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ab7153fb6a3766481599bed4e5c1e0e640d36fed971c167f367e5c95f123f0d0
#. default-sha256: b69d799ebc2c51eb66ab4ba9852f45ed41ec104f00773f8cd5bd9f39fccd9339
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_C7E77E07_8625_4BD3_B4B1_D25477A405FE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I even prepared meals for the beast, in order to teach him proper table "
"manners."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Até preparei refeições para a fera, a fim de ensinar-lhe boas maneiras à mesa."

#: scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5113d8d3e45b3674524bd1ed31cd93af167651051a4068bdadf7dbe506dacf1c
#. default-sha256: ea20e08c425191ad32969cf20ccf996c68b20608d5e93b819ddba04ff3eee249
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_07E03522_87A9_419B_9706_B7016EF22D0F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Although, with the mansion in a nearly uninhabitable state of disarray, there was only so "
"much I could do in the kitchen."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Embora, com a mansão em um estado quase inabitável de desordem, não houvesse muito que eu "
"pudesse fazer na cozinha."

#: scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d9e8304050ee22c72191e14e76100f98658422e21e4c6f17fdd747a12ca41f10
#. default-sha256: d8401c4e266de967cf64479a8bda365594bffce0187d282095701bec3779f996
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_44DCF1A1_DCDB_4D0D_85B8_19709B8DCE59"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And the only supplies I had to work with were what was left in the cellar."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫E os únicos suprimentos com que eu podia trabalhar eram os que sobraram no porão."

#: scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3acaa6b8c6099c0aac2de22ced58436d899b1420e3cbd0c2ffa9d35e3f08869d
#. default-sha256: d9bfdb9a9c78b71ef8bd2c8f2a2ea14019424ae87b16294fdc4d8aa47ac8efa5
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_A48236E7_2B15_4071_9C06_0EBE6C14F04B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫As such, I was not able to put to use the cooking skills I had learned in the flaxen-haired "
"family’s time."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Como tal, não pude colocar em prática as habilidades culinárias que aprendi no tempo da "
"família de cabelos de linho."

#: scenario2:scenario2_DDA935CC_8CFF_4500_B1F0_65752F2C3766
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c81613e97cb3624fea6ec37d1bccd6ebf8e3c43a30c6055ba50f2a378d51bbd2
#. default-sha256: dbd27bd07be087a5fb201f8dba895783b4d7b6a09343d54539cc80e4804bf4d0
msgctxt "scenario2:scenario2_DDA935CC_8CFF_4500_B1F0_65752F2C3766"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Now, now. ⟪k:5⟫You mustn’t eat with your hands.⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫Do you want to "
